      "m_dialogList": {
        "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
        "m_dialogs": [
          {
            "m_dialogTag": "Completion",
            "m_dialogEntries": [
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-FLOOD-NPC03-B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Did you disable the traps? Qismah! You look awful!",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Jackalope_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Jaki_Whisperwind_AH-FLOOD_038.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1791000,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-FLOOD-NPC03-B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Always a pleasure to hear that. It is nothing. Let us- WIZARD!",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Qismah_Shasa_AH-FLOOD_034.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1752090,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-FLOOD-NPC03-B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Ghosts? I didn't think Necromancers could be afraid of ghosts.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_WitchF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Baba_Yaga_AH-FLOOD_056.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1752125,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-FLOOD-NPC03-B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Let us continue on. There were Shellions in the Control Room. Miranda Briar must be here too.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Qismah_Shasa_AH-FLOOD_035.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1752090,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-FLOOD-NPC03-B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Ah. Well, if she's past this door, we've got a problem. It won't open. I tried pushing, pulling, asking it, kicking it, singing to it...",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Jackalope_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Jaki_Whisperwind_AH-FLOOD_039.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1791000,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-FLOOD-NPC03-B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "But it's too centrally located for it to be sealed completely. These two figures... they look like they should hold something.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_WitchF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Baba_Yaga_AH-FLOOD_057.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1752125,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-FLOOD-NPC03-B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Given the traps so far, we probably shouldn't try these orbs willy-nilly. There must be something in this city to reveal the answer.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_WitchF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Baba_Yaga_AH-FLOOD_058.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1752125,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-FLOOD-NPC03-B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Ooh, good idea! I'll look over this way.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Jackalope_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Jaki_Whisperwind_AH-FLOOD_040.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1791000,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-FLOOD-NPC03-B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Hmmm. I don't like us splitting up. You're more versed in the field, Wizard, perhaps you should reinforce them. And be wary... that vision... it was no ghost.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Qismah_Shasa_AH-FLOOD_036.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1752090,
